<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>For You ❤️</title>

<style>
    * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
    }

    body {
        min-height: 100vh;
        font-family: "Georgia", serif;
        color: white;

        /* 🌙 BACKGROUND */
        background:
            radial-gradient(circle at 20% 20%, rgba(120, 30, 60, 0.35), transparent 30%),
            radial-gradient(circle at 80% 80%, rgba(90, 20, 50, 0.30), transparent 30%),
            linear-gradient(135deg, #050505, #16070d, #050505);

        overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    /* ✨ Small stars */
    .star {
        position: fixed;
        width: 3px;
        height: 3px;
        background: white;
        border-radius: 50%;
        opacity: 0.7;
        animation: twinkle 2s infinite alternate;
    }

    @keyframes twinkle {
        from {
            opacity: 0.2;
            transform: scale(0.7);
        }
        to {
            opacity: 1;
            transform: scale(1.3);
        }
    }

    .container {
        min-height: 100vh;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        padding: 30px 20px;
    }

    .card {
        width: min(90%, 600px);
        padding: 45px 30px;
        text-align: center;

        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
        border-radius: 25px;

        backdrop-filter: blur(12px);

        box-shadow:
            0 0 40px rgba(120, 20, 50, 0.25);
    }

    .heart {
        font-size: 45px;
        animation: heartbeat 1.5s infinite;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    @keyframes heartbeat {
        0%, 100% {
            transform: scale(1);
        }
        50% {
            transform: scale(1.18);
        }
    }

    h1 {
        font-size: 38px;
        margin-bottom: 15px;
        letter-spacing: 1px;
    }

    .subtitle {
        font-size: 16px;
        color: #d8c8cc;
        line-height: 1.7;
        margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    button {
        border: none;
        padding: 13px 28px;
        border-radius: 30px;

        background: #8f294d;
        color: white;

        font-size: 15px;
        cursor: pointer;

        transition: 0.3s;
    }

    button:hover {
        transform: scale(1.06);
        background: #b33b63;
        box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(179,59,99,0.5);
    }

    .message {
        display: none;
        margin-top: 30px;
        text-align: left;
        line-height: 1.8;
        color: #eee;
        font-size: 16px;
    }

    .message p {
        margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .highlight {
        color: #ff9dbb;
    }

    .ending {
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 20px;
        color: #ffb5c9;
        margin-top: 30px;
    }
</style>
</head>

<body>

<!-- ✨ Stars -->
<div class="star" style="top:10%; left:15%;"></div>
<div class="star" style="top:20%; left:80%;"></div>
<div class="star" style="top:35%; left:30%;"></div>
<div class="star" style="top:60%; left:75%;"></div>
<div class="star" style="top:80%; left:20%;"></div>
<div class="star" style="top:90%; left:65%;"></div>

<div class="container">

    <div class="card">

        <div class="heart">♡</div>

        <h1>For You</h1>

        <div class="subtitle">
            I made this little place just for you...<br>
            So take your time and read it. 🤍
        </div>

        <button onclick="showMessage()">
            Open this ♡
        </button>

        <div class="message" id="message">

            <p>
                I really feel <span class="highlight">happy</span>
                whenever I talk to you.
            </p>

            <p>
                Sometimes you hurt me a little,
                but I don't always show it.
            </p>

            <p>
                With you, I feel safe and comfortable.
                And I have so many things in my bucket list
                that I want to do with you.
            </p>

            <p>
                I don't know how to explain it properly,
                but what I feel for you now feels
                completely different and really special to me.
            </p>

            <p>
                I still can't properly look into your eyes...
                because whenever I see you,
                my heartbeat reaches its peak. ♡
            </p>

            <p>
                My eyes are always searching for you,
                even when I already know you won't be there.
            </p>

            <p>
                And whenever you say
                <span class="highlight">"enaku oru maari irukku"</span>,
                somehow I also start feeling oru maari.
            </p>

            <p>
                I'm usually not someone who feels things
                this deeply... but when it's you,
                everything feels different.
            </p>

            <p>
                And maybe the thing that scares me the most
                is the thought that one day I might
                <span class="highlight">miss having you in my life.</span>
            </p>

            <div class="ending">
                Happy Boyfriend's Day 🤍<br><br>
                This is just a small piece of everything
                I feel for you.
            </div>

        </div>

    </div>

</div>

<script>
function showMessage() {
    document.getElementById("message").style.display = "block";
}
</script>

</body>
</html>
